==Battleground==
*The enemy base is protected by a [[Base Barrier]] until the boss is defeated.
*The enemy base here is a [[Goal Plate Base (Enemy Base)|Goal Plate Base]].
*7 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*6 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Tails (Enemy)|Tails]] spawns as the boss.
**10 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**2 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**1 [[Squire Rel]] spawns after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
**8 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**3 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

